OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss steps down after
OL,4,Asecurity issues in rooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boss of hotel chain Travelodge, Jo
OL,7,FBoydell, is stepping down as the group
OL,8,Faddresses safety issues after a sexual
OL,9,Fassault at one of its hotels.
OL,11,FA woman staying at a hotel in
OL,12,FMaidenhead, Berkshire was sexually
OL,13,Fassaulted in December 2022 after a man
OL,14,Flied to staff to get a key card to her
OL,15,Froom, triggering an independent review
OL,16,Fof security measures at the hotel
OL,17,Fgiant.
OL,19,FKyran Smith was jailed for seven years
OL,20,Fand six months for the attack.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
