OL,3,GNEWSATravelodge boss steps down after
OL,4,Asecurity issues in rooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoydell had been criticised for the
OL,7,Fcompany's handling of safety issues. In
OL,8,FMarch, the then Prime Minister Sir Keir
OL,9,FStarmer wrote to Boydell urging her to
OL,10,F"seriously engage" with the government
OL,11,Fover security at Travelodge hotels.
